{"seq":2,"slug":"parallel-reserve-merge-window","title":"分仓并发预留与合单窗口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-intelligent-split-fulfillment/parent-child-consistency/parallel-reserve-merge-window","wordCount":2872,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"分仓并发预留与合单窗口\">分仓并发预留与合单窗口</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-一个-等一会儿-的决策-与一个-抢货-的竞争\">核心概念：一个&quot;等一会儿&quot;的决策，与一个&quot;抢货&quot;的竞争</h2><p>拆单决策不是纯计算——它要在多个仓上<strong>实际预留库存</strong>，而预留是有副作用的写操作。这带来两个纠缠在一起的问题。第一，<strong>并发</strong>：多张订单几乎同时到达，都要预留同一批紧俏库存，谁先扣到谁发货，系统必须在保证「不超卖」的前提下尽快完成预留。第二，<strong>合单窗口</strong>：在决定拆几个仓之前，故意等待一小段时间，看看晚到的库存变化或稍慢的仓响应能否把方案变成「单仓发货」——等待能提升方案质量，但等待期间库存可能被别的订单抢走。这两个问题必须一起解，因为等待的代价正是并发竞争造成的。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[下单请求] --&gt; B[并发查询候选仓 ATP]&#10;  B --&gt; C{单仓可覆盖?}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[立即预留该仓&lt;br/&gt;无窗口]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| E[进入合单窗口&lt;br/&gt;等待 Δt]&#10;  E --&gt; F{窗口内更深/更晚的仓&lt;br/&gt;能否单仓覆盖?}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[取消已有候选&lt;br/&gt;预留单仓]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| H[按候选集合&lt;br/&gt;并发预留多仓]&#10;  G --&gt; I[预留结果]&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt; J{全部成功?}&#10;  J --&gt;|是| K[提交子单]&#10;  J --&gt;|否| L[回滚已预留&lt;br/&gt;重新决策或降级]\">graph TD\n  A[下单请求] --&gt; B[并发查询候选仓 ATP]\n  B --&gt; C{单仓可覆盖?}\n  C --&gt;|是| D[立即预留该仓&lt;br/&gt;无窗口]\n  C --&gt;|否| E[进入合单窗口&lt;br/&gt;等待 Δt]\n  E --&gt; F{窗口内更深/更晚的仓&lt;br/&gt;能否单仓覆盖?}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[取消已有候选&lt;br/&gt;预留单仓]\n  F --&gt;|否| H[按候选集合&lt;br/&gt;并发预留多仓]\n  G --&gt; I[预留结果]\n  H --&gt; I\n  I --&gt; J{全部成功?}\n  J --&gt;|是| K[提交子单]\n  J --&gt;|否| L[回滚已预留&lt;br/&gt;重新决策或降级]</pre><p>图中 <code>C</code> 分叉的设计含义是：<strong>只有「可能要拆」的订单才需要窗口</strong>。单仓能覆盖的订单立即预留，不进入等待——这保证窗口机制的额外延迟只落在真正受益的订单上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"并发预留的正确性\">并发预留的正确性</h2><h3 id=\"覆盖检查与预留必须是同一次操作\">覆盖检查与预留必须是同一次操作</h3><p>第一章讲过条件更新，这里展开它在多仓场景下的组合问题。天真的实现是「先并发查所有候选仓的 ATP，全部通过后并发预留」。这个两步结构有窗口期：查询与预留之间，别的订单可能已经把货扣走。正确做法是<strong>把可行性判断压进预留操作本身</strong>，用返回的影响行数当判据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 每个候选仓执行一次；返回行数为 0 表示该仓预留失败&#10;UPDATE stock_allocation&#10;SET reserved_qty = reserved_qty + $qty,&#10;    reserve_ref  = $reserve_ref&#10;WHERE warehouse_id = $wh&#10;  AND sku_id       = $sku&#10;  AND (on_hand_qty - reserved_qty - safety_qty + inbound_in_window($window)) &gt;= $qty&#10;RETURNING reserved_qty;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 每个候选仓执行一次；返回行数为 0 表示该仓预留失败</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stock_allocation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reserved_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reserved_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $qty,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    reserve_ref  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $reserve_ref</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> warehouse_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $wh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $sku</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (on_hand_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reserved_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> safety_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inbound_in_window($</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">window</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $qty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">RETURNING reserved_qty;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>多仓预留的事务边界是<strong>关键设计选择</strong>，有两种合法方案，各有明确代价：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单事务多仓</td>\n<td>全部成功或全部回滚</td>\n<td>持锁时间长，跨仓争用放大</td>\n<td>强一致、库存紧张场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>两阶段（预留 + 确认）</td>\n<td>先预留占位，决策后确认或释放</td>\n<td>需 TTL 与清理任务</td>\n<td>高并发、允许短暂占位</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两阶段方案里「预留占位」必须是<strong>带过期时间的软预留</strong>，否则崩溃的进程会永久锁住库存。TTL 的取值要覆盖整个决策链路的 P99（不是平均）耗时，且必须有一个后台清理任务扫描过期占位——这个清理任务的失败静默会表现为「库存莫名消失」，是最难排查的线上问题之一。</p>\n<h3 id=\"预留的幂等键\">预留的幂等键</h3><p>同一张订单可能因为超时重试而重复发起预留。必须用幂等键挡住重复扣减：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>reserve_ref</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>hash</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>parent_order_id</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> decision_id</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> attempt_no</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{reserve\\_ref} = \\text{hash}(\\text{parent\\_order\\_id},\\ \\text{decision\\_id},\\ \\text{attempt\\_no})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">reserve_ref</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">hash</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">parent_order_id</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">decision_id</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">attempt_no</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <code>attempt_no</code> 在同一决策内不递增——重试必须复用同一个 <code>attempt_no</code>，只有「重新决策」才产生新值。这个区分很重要：<strong>网络重试与业务重试是不同的事</strong>。网络重试要复用键（幂等），业务重试（决策已变，比如换了拆法）要用新键并显式释放旧预留。把两者混用会导致两种错误，一种是重复扣减，另一种是重复释放。</p>\n<p>HTTP 层面的对应机制是 <code>Idempotency-Key</code> 请求头，其用途正是让 POST、PATCH 这类非幂等方法具备容错能力（<a href=\"https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-httpapi-idempotency-key-header/\">The Idempotency-Key HTTP Header Field</a>）。RFC 9110 也明确指出 POST 不是幂等方法，而 PUT、DELETE 与所有安全方法（GET/HEAD/OPTIONS/TRACE）是幂等的，因此通信失败后可以自动重发（<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9110.html\">RFC 9110</a>）。这个规范事实决定了接口设计：<strong>把预留设计成「带幂等键的资源创建」而不是「幂等的 PUT」</strong>，因为预留需要携带决策上下文，用 PUT 会丢失语义。</p>\n<h3 id=\"锁顺序与死锁避免\">锁顺序与死锁避免</h3><p>多仓预留要拿多把行锁，如果不同事务以不同顺序拿锁就会死锁。避免方法是<strong>全局统一的加锁顺序</strong>：按 <code>warehouse_id</code> 字典序排列候选仓，所有事务按这个顺序加锁。这条规则简单但必须强制执行，因为它无法靠重试兜底得优雅——死锁检测会回滚其中一个事务，表现为随机的预留失败。</p>\n<p>对确实发生死锁的场景，重试策略必须有<strong>抖动</strong>：纯指数退避会让所有被回滚的事务在同一时刻再次碰撞（惊群）。标准做法是退避时间加上随机项：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>backoff</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{backoff}} = \\min\\left(t_{\\max},\\ b \\cdot 2^{k}\\right) \\cdot (1 + U(0, 0.5))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">backoff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2491em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是重试次数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U(0,0.5)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是均匀随机数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 是基准间隔。这是分布式重试的通用模式，与第二章求解器的降级链配合使用时要注意：<strong>预留重试不应触发重新求解</strong>，否则每次重试都在消耗求解预算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合单窗口的时间语义\">合单窗口的时间语义</h2><h3 id=\"窗口解决的是什么问题\">窗口解决的是什么问题</h3><p>假设订单有三件商品，仓库响应时间不一致：仓 A 在 30 ms 返回，仓 B 在 120 ms 返回。如果不等待，系统可能在 30 ms 时就基于「A 有货、B 未知」做出拆单决策，而实际上 B 也有货且能覆盖全部行项——「等一等」就能避免一次无谓的拆单。合单窗口就是用来吸收这种<strong>响应时间差异</strong>与<strong>库存波动</strong>的。</p>\n<p>窗口的收益必须用第二章的目标语言来度量才准确：一次无谓拆单的损失不是「多一个包裹」，而是<strong>总履约成本</strong>的增量（含税负项），收益 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 就是这个增量。因此窗口策略的配置参数（下面的 <code>by_scarcity</code>）应当与 <a href=\"../split-optimization/cost-transit-split-objective\">运费/时效/拆单数目标权衡</a> 的目标画像联动——在 <code>new_market_growth</code> 画像下体验权重高，窗口收益更大；在 <code>mature_cost_focus</code> 画像下则要更谨慎，因为窗口引入的延迟本身也是一种成本。</p>\n<p>窗口的收益与代价可以直接量化。设窗口长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>，窗口内「方案改善」（从多仓变单仓，或包裹数下降）的概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q(\\Delta t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，改善带来的收益为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span>（少一票运费 + 少一次操作费 + 买家体验），而窗口期间库存被抢走导致失败的概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r(\\Delta t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，失败的损失为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>（重试成本 + 可能的缺货）。期望净收益为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E(\\Delta t) = q(\\Delta t) \\cdot G - r(\\Delta t) \\cdot L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 单调增但边际递减（更长的等待不会带来更多信息），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 单调增且对紧俏商品上升很快。因此存在一个最优窗口长度，且它<strong>不该是全局常数</strong>——紧俏商品的最优窗口更短。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>商品状态</th>\n<th>建议窗口</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>库存充足（ATP ≫ 需求）</td>\n<td>较长（如 200 ms）</td>\n<td>抢货风险低，等待收益高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库存中性</td>\n<td>中等（如 80 ms）</td>\n<td>平衡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库存紧张（ATP 接近需求）</td>\n<td>很短或 0</td>\n<td>抢货风险压倒等待收益</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"窗口内并发请求的处理\">窗口内并发请求的处理</h3><p>窗口期会引入一个微妙的一致性要求：<strong>窗口期内到达的重复请求不能各自独立决策</strong>。买家快速双击提交、或客户端重试，会让同一张订单在窗口内被决策两次。处理方式是给订单加一个<strong>决策互斥锁</strong>：第一个请求持锁进入窗口，后续请求等待其决策结果并复用。这个锁的粒度是订单级（不是全局），且必须有超时释放，否则崩溃的请求会让订单永远无法下单。</p>\n<p>窗口结束时的<strong>提交是原子的</strong>：要么采用改善后的方案，要么采用窗口开始时的原始方案，不能出现「一部分仓按新方案预留、一部分按旧方案」的中间态。实现上就是在窗口结束时只提交一个 <code>decision_id</code> 对应的预留集合。</p>\n<h3 id=\"窗口与买家感知延迟的关系\">窗口与买家感知延迟的关系</h3><p>合单窗口直接加在下单主链路的延迟上，因此它必须被计入<strong>下单响应时间预算</strong>。一个务实的做法是把窗口做成<strong>可降级</strong>的：当整体下单延迟接近警戒线时，自动缩短窗口长度（甚至置零），优先保证下单不超时。这条降级路径与第二章求解器的降级链是同一种设计哲学——<strong>在资源紧张时牺牲质量而不是牺牲可用性</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;merge_window_policy&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;baseline_ms&quot;: 80,&#10;    &quot;by_scarcity&quot;: [&#10;      { &quot;atp_ratio_min&quot;: 3.0, &quot;window_ms&quot;: 200 },&#10;      { &quot;atp_ratio_min&quot;: 1.5, &quot;window_ms&quot;: 80 },&#10;      { &quot;atp_ratio_min&quot;: 0.0, &quot;window_ms&quot;: 0 }&#10;    ],&#10;    &quot;latency_guard&quot;: { &quot;p99_budget_ms&quot;: 400, &quot;on_pressure&quot;: &quot;halve_window&quot; },&#10;    &quot;decision_lock_ttl_ms&quot;: 2000,&#10;    &quot;reserve_ttl_ms&quot;: 900&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"merge_window_policy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"baseline_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"by_scarcity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"atp_ratio_min\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"window_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"atp_ratio_min\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"window_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"atp_ratio_min\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"window_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"latency_guard\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"p99_budget_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">400</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"on_pressure\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"halve_window\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"decision_lock_ttl_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"reserve_ttl_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">900</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>atp_ratio</code> 定义为「候选仓 ATP 之和 ÷ 需求量」，它把上一节的定性判断变成了可配置阈值。<code>decision_lock_ttl_ms</code> 与 <code>reserve_ttl_ms</code> 必须大于窗口长度，且 <code>reserve_ttl_ms</code> 要覆盖窗口加提交阶段，否则预留会在提交前过期。</p>\n<h2 id=\"两阶段预留的完整协议\">两阶段预留的完整协议</h2><p>把前面的规则串成可实现的流程，核心是「软预留 → 决策 → 确认或释放」三步，且每一步都可重入：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def reserve_and_decide(order, policy):&#10;    lock = acquire_decision_lock(order.id, ttl_ms=policy.decision_lock_ttl_ms)&#10;    if not lock.acquired:&#10;        return flettch_decision_result(order.id)      # 复用并发请求的结果&#10;&#10;    rref = idem_key(order.id, decision_id=order.decision_id, attempt_no=0)&#10;    holds = []&#10;    try:&#10;        for wh in sorted(candidate_warehouses(order), key=lambda w: w.id):  # 统一锁序&#10;            r = soft_reserve(wh, order.lines, ref=rref, ttl_ms=policy.reserve_ttl_ms)&#10;            if r.ok:&#10;                holds.append(r)&#10;            elif r.reason == &quot;insufficient&quot;:&#10;                continue                                  # 正常竞争失败，换仓&#10;            else:&#10;                raise ReserveError(r.reason)              # 基础设施异常，整体放弃&#10;&#10;        if covers_all(holds, order):&#10;            commit_holds(holds, rref)                     # 转为确定预留&#10;            plan = build_plan(holds)&#10;        else:&#10;            wait = window_for(order, policy)              # 见上一节的合并窗口策略&#10;            sleep_ms(min(wait, remaining_latency_budget()))&#10;            plan = re_decide_with(holds, order)           # 窗口内吸收更晚的仓响应&#10;            commit_holds(holds, rref)&#10;        return persist_decision(order, plan, holds)&#10;    except Exception:&#10;        release_holds(holds, rref)                        # 条件性释放，见下&#10;        raise&#10;    finally:&#10;        lock.release()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reserve_and_decide</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order, policy):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    lock </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> acquire_decision_lock(order.id, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ttl_ms</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">policy.decision_lock_ttl_ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lock.acquired:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> flettch_decision_result(order.id)      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 复用并发请求的结果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    rref </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idem_key(order.id, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">decision_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">order.decision_id, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">attempt_no</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    holds </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wh </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sorted</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(candidate_warehouses(order), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=lambda</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w: w.id):  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 统一锁序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> soft_reserve(wh, order.lines, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ref</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">rref, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ttl_ms</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">policy.reserve_ttl_ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.ok:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                holds.append(r)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            elif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.reason </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"insufficient\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                continue</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                                  # 正常竞争失败，换仓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                raise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ReserveError(r.reason)              </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 基础设施异常，整体放弃</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> covers_all(holds, order):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            commit_holds(holds, rref)                     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 转为确定预留</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            plan </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> build_plan(holds)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            wait </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> window_for(order, policy)              </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 见上一节的合并窗口策略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            sleep_ms(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(wait, remaining_latency_budget()))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            plan </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> re_decide_with(holds, order)           </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 窗口内吸收更晚的仓响应</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            commit_holds(holds, rref)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> persist_decision(order, plan, holds)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    except</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Exception</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        release_holds(holds, rref)                        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 条件性释放，见下</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        raise</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    finally</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        lock.release()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两处细节决定这份代码在线上是否安全。第一，<code>release_holds</code> 必须是<strong>条件性释放</strong>——只释放 <code>reserve_ref</code> 仍等于本次 <code>rref</code> 的占位，因为 TTL 过期后可能的另一个流程已经接管了这批库存。第二，<code>raise ReserveError</code> 与 <code>continue</code> 的区分不能省：把基础设施异常当成「库存不足」会让系统在数据库抖动时疯狂换仓，产生大量无意义的跨区改派。区分两者靠的是<strong>错误分类</strong>：影响行数为 0（条件不满足）是竞争失败，连接超时/死锁（SQLSTATE <code>40001</code>、<code>40P01</code>）是基础设施异常。</p>\n<p>第三个细节在提交阶段：<code>commit_holds</code> 把软预留转为确定预留，这一步会写入子单并落库。落库必须与预留确认<strong>在同一事务</strong>内完成，且子单的落库使用 <a href=\"parent-child-order-model\">父单/子单数据模型</a> 定义的 <code>UNIQUE (parent_order_id, seq_no)</code> 约束做幂等——如果事务在提交后被重试，重复插入会被约束挡住而不是产生重复子单。若把落库与确认分开两个事务，进程在中间崩溃会留下「库存已确定预留但没有对应子单」的孤儿占位，它只能靠 TTL 清理，而 TTL 清理的时间窗内这批库存对系统是不可见的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>拆单要<strong>实际预留库存</strong>，因此并发正确性与时间窗口是两个必须一起解的问题。</li>\n<li>可行性判断必须<strong>压进预留操作本身</strong>（条件更新 + 检查影响行数），不能先查后改。</li>\n<li>多仓预留的事务边界有两种合法选择：<strong>单事务多仓</strong>（强一致、持锁久）或<strong>两阶段软预留 + TTL</strong>（高并发、需清理任务）；软预留的 TTL 必须覆盖决策链路的 P99。</li>\n<li>预留幂等键要区分<strong>网络重试</strong>（复用键）与<strong>业务重试</strong>（新键 + 显式释放旧预留）；HTTP 层面用 <code>Idempotency-Key</code>，注意 POST 并非幂等方法。</li>\n<li>多仓加锁必须<strong>全局统一顺序</strong>（按 warehouse_id 排序），重试退避必须带<strong>随机抖动</strong>，且预留重试不重新求解。</li>\n<li><strong>合单窗口</strong>的收益是避免无谓拆单，代价是库存被抢；最优窗口长度随库存紧张度下降，应配置化而非全局常数。</li>\n<li>窗口内同一订单的并发请求需<strong>决策级互斥锁</strong>（带 TTL），窗口结束时<strong>原子提交</strong>一个方案，不出现中间态。</li>\n<li>窗口应<strong>可降级</strong>：下单延迟逼近预算时自动缩短或置零，牺牲方案质量而非下单可用性。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分仓并发预留与合单窗口","id":"分仓并发预留与合单窗口"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：一个\"等一会儿\"的决策，与一个\"抢货\"的竞争","id":"核心概念-一个-等一会儿-的决策-与一个-抢货-的竞争"},{"level":2,"text":"并发预留的正确性","id":"并发预留的正确性"},{"level":3,"text":"覆盖检查与预留必须是同一次操作","id":"覆盖检查与预留必须是同一次操作"},{"level":3,"text":"预留的幂等键","id":"预留的幂等键"},{"level":3,"text":"锁顺序与死锁避免","id":"锁顺序与死锁避免"},{"level":2,"text":"合单窗口的时间语义","id":"合单窗口的时间语义"},{"level":3,"text":"窗口解决的是什么问题","id":"窗口解决的是什么问题"},{"level":3,"text":"窗口内并发请求的处理","id":"窗口内并发请求的处理"},{"level":3,"text":"窗口与买家感知延迟的关系","id":"窗口与买家感知延迟的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"两阶段预留的完整协议","id":"两阶段预留的完整协议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"父单/子单数据模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-intelligent-split-fulfillment/parent-child-consistency/parent-child-order-model"},"next":{"title":"子单状态聚合到父单","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-intelligent-split-fulfillment/parent-child-consistency/child-status-aggregate"}}